          ponto onde você pode se plugar. Os em
          <span style="color: #fb7185; font-weight: 700">vermelho</span> podem
          <strong>bloquear ou alterar</strong> — esses são os hooks de
          poder.</span
        ><span data-lang="en"
          >Pi emits events at every stage of the agent loop. Each is a place you
          can plug in. The ones in
          <span style="color: #fb7185; font-weight: 700">red</span> can
          <strong>block or mutate</strong> — those are the power hooks.</span
        >
      </p>

